  "post_content": "<p>La XIII carrera de San Silvestre, organizada por el Club Atletisme Onda, ha contado con la participaci&oacute;n de alrecedor de 400 ondenses de todas las edades, con divertidos disfraces, la mayor&iacute;a de personajes navide&ntilde;os.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/IMG_0026.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Al final se ha premiado a los tres mejores disfraces, y se ha repartido coca y chocolate para reponer fuerzas. Tambi&eacute;n se han sorteado regalos entre las personas que han participado.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santsilvestreonda17/img_0011.jpg\" alt=\"img_0011\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santsilvestreonda17/img_0012.jpg\" alt=\"img_0012\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santsilvestreonda17/img_0013.jpg\" alt=\"img_0013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santsilvestreonda17/img_0014.jpg\" alt=\"img_0014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santsilvestreonda17/img_0015.jpg\" alt=\"img_0015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santsilvestreonda17/img_0016.jpg\" alt=\"img_0016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santsilvestreonda17/img_0017.jpg\" alt=\"img_0017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santsilvestreonda17/img_0018.jpg\" alt=\"img_0018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santsi